OL,3,GNEWSAClub wants M4 weekend closure for
OL,4,Apower work moved
OL,5,
OL,6,FReading FC has urged an electricity
OL,7,Fdistributor to reschedule a planned
OL,8,Fmotorway closure over fears it will
OL,9,Fdelay fans and staff getting to one of
OL,10,Fits home matches.
OL,12,FScottish and Southern Electricity
OL,13,FNetworks (SSEN) said shutting the M4
OL,14,Fnear Reading next month was the "only
OL,15,Fsafe, practical way" to run new
OL,16,Fhigh-voltage wires across it after a
OL,17,Fpylon was damaged in a storm in
OL,18,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
