OL,3,GNEWSAClub wants M4 weekend closure for
OL,4,Apower work moved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royals said the closure would cause
OL,7,Fissues for those attending the League
OL,8,FOne match against Notts County on 20
OL,9,FSeptember.
OL,11,FSSEN said it had approved the work,
OL,12,Fbetween junctions 10 (Winnersh) and 11
OL,13,F(Reading), before the club's fixtures
OL,14,Fwere released in June.
